[
  {
    "text": "\"I will listen.\"",
    "zh": "我會好好聽。",
    "episode_date": "2026-10-28",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-10-28-p00_006.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "\"May I touch it, please?\"",
    "zh": "我可以摸摸看嗎？請問。",
    "episode_date": "2026-10-29",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-10-29-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "\"Okay, I will stop.\"",
    "zh": "好，我會停下來。",
    "episode_date": "2026-10-30",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-10-30-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Different is okay.",
    "zh": "不一樣也沒關係。",
    "episode_date": "2026-10-31",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-10-31-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "\"I will wait my turn.\"",
    "zh": "「我會等輪到我。」",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-03",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-03-p00_008.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I use kind words.",
    "zh": "我說溫暖的話。",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-04",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-04-p00_008.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "I am gentle.",
    "zh": "我很溫柔。",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-05",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-05-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "May I come in?",
    "zh": "我可以進來嗎？",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-06",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-06-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "You go first.",
    "zh": "您先請。",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-07",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-07-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Let's share!",
    "zh": "我們一起來分享！",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-08",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-08-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "Can I hug you?",
    "zh": "我可以抱抱你嗎？",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-10",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-10-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "You can do it!",
    "zh": "你做得到！",
    "episode_date": "2026-11-11",
    "audio": "assets/repeat/2026-11-11-p00_007.mp3"
  },
  {
    "text": "No, thank you.",
    "zh": "不用了，謝謝。",
